      "description": "Develop networking software for Amazon Leo’s low Earth orbit satellite system, supporting the adaptation of its commercial network architecture for specialized government customer requirements.\n\n• Develop software-defined networking capabilities that integrate government use cases with Amazon Leo’s commercial system.\n• Build simulated constellation test infrastructure to validate network behavior and system integrations.\n• Develop a simulated ground gateway that enables physical lab equipment to communicate with the software-defined network.\n• Work across network control, simulation, lab infrastructure, and hardware-software integration to solve complex networking problems.",
      "insights": ""
     },
     {
      "title": "Senior Software Engineer - Merch on Demand Fulfillment Technology",
      "locationName": "Seattle, WA · On-site",
      "timePeriod": {
